@startuml Circular_Linked_List

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #6b7280
skinparam RectangleBorderColor #2F3B4A
skinparam RoundCorner 12
skinparam Shadowing false

' --- color palette ---
!define C1 #667eea
!define C2 #48bb78
!define C3 #ed8936
!define C4 #f56565

' --- nodes ---
rectangle "Node 1 (Head)" as N1 C1
rectangle "Node 2" as N2 C2
rectangle "Node 3" as N3 C3
rectangle "Node 4 (Tail)" as N4 C4

' --- arrows ---
N1 -down-> N2 : next
N2 -down-> N3 : next
N3 -down-> N4 : next
N4 -up-> N1 : back to head

note bottom
Each node has:
 • pointer to next
 • pointer to prev
The last node points back to the first, forming a closed loop.
end note

@enduml
